VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-autonomous-agent-intake#4', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-autonomous-agent-intake', 4, 'Initial questions',
  '## Initial questions

- What architectural patterns should Techscope extract from Hermes?
- How does Hermes differ from OpenClaw, Codex and Claude Code?
- Which Hermes ideas are portable to our Codex-first setup?
- Which claims are marketing and need local verification?
- Is Hermes worth a local experiment on Mac mini/VPS?', 'af8f866b57bdcb07061363366cea4996f4303119aaa29c3c828390217e5007b4', 71
