VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-youtube-claude-code-32-hacks-intake#2', '2026-05-17-youtube-claude-code-32-hacks-intake', 2, 'Why this may matter',
  '## Why this may matter

The video is a dense practical list of Claude Code workflow patterns: context hygiene, planning, subagents, skills, hooks, screenshots, browser checks, worktrees, permissions and fresh-doc MCP usage. It is useful for Techscope because many ideas can be adapted to Codex, but the source is strongly Claude Code-specific and must not be copied literally.', '821004d9c71b30af1fee8c6a388178842d0f437119568ea57e20f0f2a5490bd2', 79
);
