  '2026-05-17-youtube-hermes-agent-setup-openclaw-killer-intake#4', '2026-05-17-youtube-hermes-agent-setup-openclaw-killer-intake', 4, 'Initial questions',
  '## Initial questions

- Which parts of the setup flow are generally portable to our future agents?
