INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-youtube-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-intake#2', '2026-05-27-youtube-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-intake', 2, 'Why this may matter',
  '## Why this may matter

The video is not mainly useful as a Hermes feature list. We already have Hermes,
OpenClaw, Codex CLI, Obsidian and cron-related materials. The new signal is a
practical operating model for a personal team of agents: one coordinator,
specialized role agents, reusable skills, scheduled reports, daily notes and
notification discipline.', '5166025a3780b58330b76def9ff0380c70d52b84a1f96cc1be25ace5bafbde32', 75
);
