Status: draft', 'Source Note: Codex Xcode Simulator screenshot debugging', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#1');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#2', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', 2, 'What this source is',
  '## What this source is

Telegram-forwarded post from `AI RANEZ #217` claiming Codex can make screenshots of phone apps and that this helps debugging. The attached screenshot shows Codex working on a UI/onboarding task while an iPhone Simulator is open; a screenshot thumbnail appears inside the Codex thread.', '9b5190e53423ea90f564df20be518634e28cc920a3c0b023244f39f1dc0d11e6', 65
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## What this source is

Telegram-forwarded post from `AI RANEZ #217` claiming Codex can make screenshots of phone apps and that this helps debugging. The attached screenshot shows Codex working on a UI/onboarding task while an iPhone Simulator is open; a screenshot thumbnail appears inside the Codex thread.', 'What this source is', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#3', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', 3, 'What is visible',
  '## What is visible

- Codex tab is active next to `Chat` and `Claude Code`.
- Task title: `Plan UI and onboarding updates`.
- Codex references app preference state and says a stricter reset is needed.
- Codex has run commands and is inspecting local app files.
- iPhone Simulator shows a `Library` screen with onboarding/empty-state UI.
- Codex thread includes a screenshot artifact.', '12592d1dab7605ae2fd8a69004b68f190684ccb59160b107dc0c2dd35a5aa5ce', 87
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## What is visible

- Codex tab is active next to `Chat` and `Claude Code`.
- Task title: `Plan UI and onboarding updates`.
- Codex references app preference state and says a stricter reset is needed.
- Codex has run commands and is inspecting local app files.
- iPhone Simulator shows a `Library` screen with onboarding/empty-state UI.
- Codex thread includes a screenshot artifact.', 'What is visible', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#4', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', 4, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

This supports a valuable mobile-development workflow: a coding agent should be able to collect visual state from the simulator, use it as evidence, and keep iterating without manual screenshot drag-and-drop by the user.', '2f8c8482add30a1853a4f8a40c876a9c1f0fb6b592b5fca54a8ba51e2c26f490', 50
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

This supports a valuable mobile-development workflow: a coding agent should be able to collect visual state from the simulator, use it as evidence, and keep iterating without manual screenshot drag-and-drop by the user.', 'Why it matters', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#5', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', 5, 'Caveats',
  '## Caveats

- The post''s claim about Claude Code is not verified.
- The exact mechanism is not proven by the screenshot. It could be Xcode Simulator support, command-line screenshot capture, app-specific tooling or Codex Desktop integration.
- Before standardizing, test locally with a minimal iOS project.', '1ae491027c7bb3ae5efea002bb9042760a9301f51c58858f87c0f4413d3ce7f8', 64
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Caveats

- The post''s claim about Claude Code is not verified.
- The exact mechanism is not proven by the screenshot. It could be Xcode Simulator support, command-line screenshot capture, app-specific tooling or Codex Desktop integration.
- Before standardizing, test locally with a minimal iOS project.', 'Caveats', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note', '2026-05-17-codex-xcode-simulator-screenshot-debugging-source-note#5');

