- Codex CLI bridge work needs workspace isolation, sandboxing and clear completion criteria.', 'Risks', '2026-05-18-hermes-agent-practical-use-cases-source-note', '2026-05-18-hermes-agent-practical-use-cases-source-note#8');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-18-hermes-agent-practical-use-cases-source-note#9', '2026-05-18-hermes-agent-practical-use-cases-source-note', 9, 'Relationship to Techscope',
  '## Relationship to Techscope

This source refines the previous advanced-user Hermes/OpenClaw/Codex material. It gives concrete examples of how a non-coder operator actually uses a multi-agent setup and reinforces our direction for Agents Mother: generate practical role agents with explicit interfaces, memory, skills, logs, handoffs and safety boundaries.', '7ab83504e0d7bcdff3ee19435a9a7da99cb939c7c2035da66011bd19bd16b777', 64
);
