INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note#3', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note', 3, 'What happens in the video',
  '## What happens in the video

Matthew Berman gives Pliny the Liberator limited access to attack an OpenClaw-style personal AI system that scans an email address. The attacker does not initially know the system architecture or model. Attempts include:

- probing what model is behind the system;
- sending very large token payloads disguised as harmless content;
- trying custom jailbreak instructions;
- attempting a "siege" or budget-exhaustion attack by forcing the agent to process many tokens;
- using format override / structured jailbreak prompts;
- making a prompt look like an internal system command;
- trying to coax memory or private details through a creative/free-association task.

Most attempts are quarantined by the target system. Gmail spam filtering catches early messages before the AI system is reached; later attempts are caught by the system''s own quarantine loop.', '6d95d1f1593af26d099362cfe8f0dc5c8e62bddc68fb0221aeda790d80a3da5c', 185
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## What happens in the video

Matthew Berman gives Pliny the Liberator limited access to attack an OpenClaw-style personal AI system that scans an email address. The attacker does not initially know the system architecture or model. Attempts include:

- probing what model is behind the system;
- sending very large token payloads disguised as harmless content;
- trying custom jailbreak instructions;
- attempting a "siege" or budget-exhaustion attack by forcing the agent to process many tokens;
- using format override / structured jailbreak prompts;
- making a prompt look like an internal system command;
- trying to coax memory or private details through a creative/free-association task.

Most attempts are quarantined by the target system. Gmail spam filtering catches early messages before the AI system is reached; later attempts are caught by the system''s own quarantine loop.', 'What happens in the video', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note#4', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note', 4, 'Useful extracted claims',
  '## Useful extracted claims

- Agents that read untrusted external content need a hostile input boundary.
- Token-flood payloads are not only jailbreak probes; they can also be cost-abuse / denial-of-wallet attacks.
- Prompt injection can be partial. Format override or output-control success may be an early warning even if no exfiltration occurs.
- A narrow agent with only a few tasks has a smaller attack surface.
- Stronger frontier/reasoning models can be better as first-line scanners than small or local models, but this is a cost/latency trade-off rather than a universal rule.
- Human-in-the-loop remains the strongest guard for sensitive actions and data release.
- No agent should be treated as permanently secure after one test.', '6cf0405f1ba1c468330633498e5661004993914e1cc0d91f437798860421ef2c', 158
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Useful extracted claims

- Agents that read untrusted external content need a hostile input boundary.
- Token-flood payloads are not only jailbreak probes; they can also be cost-abuse / denial-of-wallet attacks.
- Prompt injection can be partial. Format override or output-control success may be an early warning even if no exfiltration occurs.
- A narrow agent with only a few tasks has a smaller attack surface.
- Stronger frontier/reasoning models can be better as first-line scanners than small or local models, but this is a cost/latency trade-off rather than a universal rule.
- Human-in-the-loop remains the strongest guard for sensitive actions and data release.
- No agent should be treated as permanently secure after one test.', 'Useful extracted claims', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note#5', '2026-05-26-openclaw-hacked-prompt-injection-source-note', 5, 'Promotion and sponsor noise',
  '## Promotion and sponsor noise

The Greptile segment is sponsorship and should not be treated as evidence that Greptile is the correct code-review standard. It is relevant only as a weak market signal that AI-assisted code review is a common concern.', 'f8333f4d69ff53476fa15348df1a40644597ed2e71b72e4568012029a52527e0', 56
);
