INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-15-youtube-local-transcription-test-brief#10', '2026-05-15-youtube-local-transcription-test-brief', 10, 'Recommendation',
  '## Recommendation

Status: `successful experiment`.

This is enough evidence to keep improving the `local-video-to-structured-text` standard. Do not mark the standard active yet; run one more test with:

- a longer YouTube video;
- a noisy or multi-speaker video;
- ideally a video where YouTube subtitles exist, so we can compare captions vs local ASR.', '74e6061463c41b4355447b7676c7845011bd9e1532a4c594ccb0558a26162801', 73
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Recommendation

Status: `successful experiment`.

This is enough evidence to keep improving the `local-video-to-structured-text` standard. Do not mark the standard active yet; run one more test with:

- a longer YouTube video;
- a noisy or multi-speaker video;
- ideally a video where YouTube subtitles exist, so we can compare captions vs local ASR.', 'Recommendation', '2026-05-15-youtube-local-transcription-test-brief', '2026-05-15-youtube-local-transcription-test-brief#10');

