INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief#2', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

Hermes Agent is an open-source, model-agnostic autonomous agent runtime from Nous Research. It is not just a CLI coding assistant; it is closer to a long-running personal agent platform with CLI, gateway, messaging, cron, memory, skills, toolsets, MCP, terminal backends, plugins, session search and optional external memory providers.

For Techscope, Hermes is important because it offers a concrete architecture for self-hosted, persistent, multi-surface agents. The strongest patterns are bounded memory, procedural skills, gateway authorization, toolset narrowing, progressive project context discovery and server/VPS operation.', '06c8625ad72ea2bd7126f3d8b5107ea9a147e82b0698af0081bc1fa8fd387170', 115
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

Hermes Agent is an open-source, model-agnostic autonomous agent runtime from Nous Research. It is not just a CLI coding assistant; it is closer to a long-running personal agent platform with CLI, gateway, messaging, cron, memory, skills, toolsets, MCP, terminal backends, plugins, session search and optional external memory providers.

For Techscope, Hermes is important because it offers a concrete architecture for self-hosted, persistent, multi-surface agents. The strongest patterns are bounded memory, procedural skills, gateway authorization, toolset narrowing, progressive project context discovery and server/VPS operation.', 'Summary', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief#3', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-brief', 3, 'Key claims',
  '## Key claims

- Hermes'' core differentiator is the closed learning loop: memory + skill creation + skill refinement + session search.
- It is model/provider agnostic and can route across many providers or custom endpoints.
- It runs through multiple surfaces: CLI, messaging gateway, cron, API server, ACP/IDE and batch runner.
- It treats tools as configurable toolsets, which is valuable for controlling autonomy per platform and task.
- It supports project context files including `AGENTS.md`, `.hermes.md`, `HERMES.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and Cursor rules.
- It uses SQLite/FTS5 for session persistence and search.
- It has a substantial security model, but the blast radius is still large because it can run commands, connect to messaging platforms and operate long-running tasks.', 'ebdb81ebc2cdf9102d6b961cadd57a2be670812a77cdad8a9e12bcc5e5ce1ba8', 161
);
