INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-16-test-first-agent-workflow-review#13', '2026-05-16-test-first-agent-workflow-review', 13, 'Candidate Rule',
  '## Candidate Rule

For non-trivial coding-agent work, Codex should establish a verification contract before implementation:

- spec or issue summary;
- scope and non-goals;
- acceptance criteria;
- expected commands;
- tests/evals/fixtures when practical;
- security and bad-input cases for agent-facing features.

Implementation should then proceed against that contract, and the final response should report actual commands run and results.', 'f6e2376b315c2f863dffd639847d903da3d7816dab917bd2d84c4516ddc14a47', 81
);
