VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability#12', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability', 12, 'Research Scout',
  '### Research Scout

The current research direction supports minimal context files and explicit configuration mechanisms. The latest official docs show rapid divergence in details, so every environment profile needs dates and versions.', '4f58f2bc265a4d15fa329409ea65dfcc16399266864c6b129efc184a44a75775', 44
);
