VALUES ('## Risk

Score: 5/5

High risk if deployed casually. Hermes can run commands, connect messaging platforms, store memory, load skills/plugins, use MCP and run scheduled tasks. It needs isolation and staged rollout.', 'Risk', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-assessment', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-architecture-assessment#14');

