- Transparent skills/tools are valuable because users can see whether an agent is doing relevant work.
- Business-facing agents need intermediary bots and limited surfaces, not raw terminal instructions.
- Generated wiki memory should be compiled and maintained, but standards/decisions must still cite source artifacts.', 'Technical claims', '2026-05-17-openclaw-hermes-codex-cli-advanced-user-assessment', '2026-05-17-openclaw-hermes-codex-cli-advanced-user-assessment#4');

