INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#13', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', 13, 'Programming',
  '### Programming

Prefer the simplest working integration boundary. If a local CLI or script already does the job, wrap it in a skill. If the integration requires a long-lived server, protocol, auth lifecycle or centralized state, use MCP.', 'e145369fee5ab081664f2a7ada1a960dca6b43b85312c9aaa61ef05a664aa4c9', 52
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Programming

Prefer the simplest working integration boundary. If a local CLI or script already does the job, wrap it in a skill. If the integration requires a long-lived server, protocol, auth lifecycle or centralized state, use MCP.', 'Programming', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#13');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#14', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', 14, 'Agent Engineering',
  '### Agent Engineering

Skills are ideal for "how to do this task here" and should be written as agent operating procedures. MCP is ideal for "what external capability exists and how to call it through a stable interface". Combining both is often the best architecture.', '876166a83e8fecb127e00a96318967d4b3c84f27711e9ed63e000b89e5f54bd8', 61
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Agent Engineering

Skills are ideal for "how to do this task here" and should be written as agent operating procedures. MCP is ideal for "what external capability exists and how to call it through a stable interface". Combining both is often the best architecture.', 'Agent Engineering', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#14');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#15', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', 15, 'DX',
  '### DX

Skills make team workflows easier to share as files. MCP makes shared service integrations easier to maintain centrally. The best developer experience depends on avoiding both extremes.', '26cdcd38bb55389353ff3833f748e7a6dd3d0b1f6d7d6bc92542036bddff7d36', 40
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### DX

Skills make team workflows easier to share as files. MCP makes shared service integrations easier to maintain centrally. The best developer experience depends on avoiding both extremes.', 'DX', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#15');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment#16', '2026-05-17-skills-vs-mcp-agent-tooling-assessment', 16, 'Security',
  '### Security

Skill scripts must be reviewed like code. MCP servers must be reviewed like service integrations. Secrets should not be placed in prompt-readable files; use environment variables, OS keychains, mature CLIs or server-side auth boundaries.', '66a2425629caf732cfb69d06307e0295765698a04e294423413e66415618187d', 49
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Security

