7. Memory registration in Techscope.', 'Recommendation', '2026-05-18-techscope-agents-mother-scenario-review', '2026-05-18-techscope-agents-mother-scenario-review#8');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-18-techscope-agents-mother-scenario-review#9', '2026-05-18-techscope-agents-mother-scenario-review', 9, 'Open questions',
  '## Open questions

- Should v1 generate only Codex-project agents, or support API/CLI/local model branches immediately?
- What should be the canonical sibling folder root?
- Should created agents get their own Obsidian/Markdown memory by default?
- Do we want a reusable `scripts/create-agent.mjs` scaffold generator in Techscope?
- Should every created agent be registered in a Techscope index/catalog?', '2ddcb1005a7a2ea973359be24c99c96dd7d0d05a96a165462144a71587eb4bfc', 79
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Open questions

