- Environment-specific caveats: do not assume Claude Code, Gemini CLI or Cursor have equivalent goal semantics.', 'Agent environment profile', '2026-05-21-openai-codex-goals-assessment', '2026-05-21-openai-codex-goals-assessment#5');

