Recommendation: standard', 'Assessment: OpenClaw Local Inference Cost Pattern', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#1');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#2', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', 2, 'One-paragraph read',
  '## One-paragraph read

This is a valuable architecture pattern, not a reliable hardware buying guide.
The durable idea is to route agent subtasks by required capability, risk,
frequency and privacy: strong cloud models for discovery/coding/planning, local
or smaller models for stable repeated extraction, transcription, embeddings,
classification and memory queries. The sponsor-heavy parts and exact savings
numbers should not be accepted as facts without project-specific measurement.', '75ef4117a15101cabb0d3b3b710856b0e0db9b8971dc8a019b859fd23bec988a', 88
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## One-paragraph read

This is a valuable architecture pattern, not a reliable hardware buying guide.
The durable idea is to route agent subtasks by required capability, risk,
frequency and privacy: strong cloud models for discovery/coding/planning, local
or smaller models for stable repeated extraction, transcription, embeddings,
classification and memory queries. The sponsor-heavy parts and exact savings
numbers should not be accepted as facts without project-specific measurement.', 'One-paragraph read', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#3', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', 3, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

Agents Mother is already creating agents with voice, memory, media ingestion and
semantic search. Those systems can create recurring model spend. A runtime
placement policy lets us design cost and privacy into the harness instead of
discovering the bill later.', '8a144d510245d9f1326ebf160253a09ea4b5d4ce8b90eeae705ad2e8371d68c8', 60
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

Agents Mother is already creating agents with voice, memory, media ingestion and
semantic search. Those systems can create recurring model spend. A runtime
placement policy lets us design cost and privacy into the harness instead of
discovering the bill later.', 'Why it matters', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#4', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', 4, 'Technical claims',
  '## Technical claims

- Local inference can be exposed through OpenAI-compatible local endpoints.
- LM Studio is a practical operator-friendly way to run local models and local
  APIs.
- NVIDIA RTX/DGX Spark hardware can run substantial local models, but model size
  depends on VRAM/unified memory, quantization and latency targets.
- Stable, narrow subtasks are better local candidates than broad planning or
  coding tasks.
- Frontier cloud models remain the safer default while the workflow is unknown.', 'af05ec4273db3c6255cbc78899f5e38b7c5385b83ebcec05b564d3b87ae71c05', 103
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Technical claims

- Local inference can be exposed through OpenAI-compatible local endpoints.
- LM Studio is a practical operator-friendly way to run local models and local
  APIs.
- NVIDIA RTX/DGX Spark hardware can run substantial local models, but model size
  depends on VRAM/unified memory, quantization and latency targets.
- Stable, narrow subtasks are better local candidates than broad planning or
  coding tasks.
- Frontier cloud models remain the safer default while the workflow is unknown.', 'Technical claims', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#5', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', 5, 'Agent environment profile',
  '## Agent environment profile

- Agent platforms: OpenClaw source pattern, Codex/Agents Mother target pattern.
- Model context: mixed local open-weight models plus hosted frontier models.
- Runtime environment: hybrid local/cloud.
- Config surfaces: agent contract, routing manifest, operations manifest, evals.
- Portability: portable.
- Codex adaptation: add a runtime-placement section to future agent contracts
  and scaffold routing manifests as placeholders unless the contract requires a
  working local model server.
- Environment-specific caveats: LM Studio, NVIDIA OpenShell and GPU-host routing
  are adapter-specific and should not be assumed in every agent.', '383e6aef67a3395bca2239572a03d87d93a78c4c9a773a6a2d703b4bcb2fda31', 121
);
