INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#2', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 2, 'One-paragraph read',
  '## One-paragraph read

The video is useful as an operating-model example: treat a mature personal agent
setup as a team with roles, skills, schedules and feedback loops. It does not
prove Hermes is universally better, and it does not give us a template to copy.
It does add concrete design questions for Agents Mother: when to split roles,
how to route work, how to schedule reports, how to preserve daily memory and how
to prevent proactive agents from becoming noise.', 'f76a58961102206cae43830a62e86bce42362d16cfd1d891c7492fbc7a1bec1c', 108
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## One-paragraph read

The video is useful as an operating-model example: treat a mature personal agent
setup as a team with roles, skills, schedules and feedback loops. It does not
prove Hermes is universally better, and it does not give us a template to copy.
It does add concrete design questions for Agents Mother: when to split roles,
how to route work, how to schedule reports, how to preserve daily memory and how
to prevent proactive agents from becoming noise.', 'One-paragraph read', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#3', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 3, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

We are building agents that may grow beyond one chat interface. Without a team
model, they become one large prompt with too many tools and too much memory. A
role-based operating model gives us a cleaner way to design specialist agents,
sidecar workers and scheduled routines.', '589986a77a0e82417f013e15fe8fe27275c882c5ab6b86a26c43bff6d850fe0b', 68
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

We are building agents that may grow beyond one chat interface. Without a team
model, they become one large prompt with too many tools and too much memory. A
role-based operating model gives us a cleaner way to design specialist agents,
sidecar workers and scheduled routines.', 'Why it matters', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#4', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 4, 'Technical claims',
  '## Technical claims

- Specialist roles should own specialist context and skills.
- A coordinator should route tasks rather than do every job itself.
- Cron jobs are useful but need explicit skills/toolsets and self-contained
  prompts.
- Delegated subagents need explicit context because they do not inherit full
  parent history.
- Daily notes plus a reflection agent can turn raw interaction logs into
  operational memory.
- Notification volume is an architectural setting, not a UX afterthought.', 'de199ce4e874de2808e57a1f07f54589f9a52899f017bd95ba0da5c262d9e834', 103
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Technical claims

- Specialist roles should own specialist context and skills.
- A coordinator should route tasks rather than do every job itself.
- Cron jobs are useful but need explicit skills/toolsets and self-contained
  prompts.
- Delegated subagents need explicit context because they do not inherit full
  parent history.
- Daily notes plus a reflection agent can turn raw interaction logs into
  operational memory.
- Notification volume is an architectural setting, not a UX afterthought.', 'Technical claims', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#5', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 5, 'Agent environment profile',
  '## Agent environment profile

- Agent platforms: Hermes source; Codex/Agents Mother target.
- Model context: mixed role-specific models.
- Runtime environment: messaging gateway, local agent, cron, Obsidian memory,
  Codex CLI sidecar.
- Config surfaces: skills, cron jobs, delegation, vault, notification policy.
- Portability: adapter-needed.
- Codex adaptation: express as agent-contract fields and local workflows, not as
  Hermes-specific file copying.
- Environment-specific caveats: Hermes Curator/cron/delegation semantics do not
  automatically exist in Codex projects.', 'cc69fc0f1f892480ca526457baf851c053084c5eeebc51ca7ae5f9228d585591', 98
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Agent environment profile

- Agent platforms: Hermes source; Codex/Agents Mother target.
- Model context: mixed role-specific models.
- Runtime environment: messaging gateway, local agent, cron, Obsidian memory,
  Codex CLI sidecar.
- Config surfaces: skills, cron jobs, delegation, vault, notification policy.
- Portability: adapter-needed.
- Codex adaptation: express as agent-contract fields and local workflows, not as
  Hermes-specific file copying.
- Environment-specific caveats: Hermes Curator/cron/delegation semantics do not
  automatically exist in Codex projects.', 'Agent environment profile', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#5');

