INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment#2', '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment', 2, 'One-paragraph read',
  '## One-paragraph read

This is useful, but only if we store the evaluation discipline rather than the
winner list. The benchmark shows how to compare harnesses under controlled local
conditions, and the n8n-like task shows why hidden coding tasks are not enough.
For Techscope, the right move is to require a small, project-specific eval pack
before choosing OpenCode, Pi, Hermes, OpenClaw or any local-model harness for a
new agent.', 'a400aed88ed39e4364cf3415636a2dd74fc3b81f853dc42cf420cef856e286a2', 94
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## One-paragraph read

This is useful, but only if we store the evaluation discipline rather than the
winner list. The benchmark shows how to compare harnesses under controlled local
conditions, and the n8n-like task shows why hidden coding tasks are not enough.
For Techscope, the right move is to require a small, project-specific eval pack
before choosing OpenCode, Pi, Hermes, OpenClaw or any local-model harness for a
new agent.', 'One-paragraph read', '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment', '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment#3', '2026-05-27-local-agent-harness-benchmark-assessment', 3, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

Agents Mother will increasingly face decisions like: "build this new agent in
Codex, OpenCode, Pi, Hermes, OpenClaw, custom CLI or API harness?" Without evals,
that becomes vibes plus YouTube rankings. With evals, it becomes a repeatable
engineering decision.', '2ca3d248e15afe575f4b28b2ff02c99cfa64e2a6866edadf37f01db73da360ac', 57
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

Agents Mother will increasingly face decisions like: "build this new agent in
