INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#11', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', 11, 'Product Pragmatist',
  '### Product Pragmatist

Adopt patterns that prevent repeated support/debug loops. Defer patterns that mainly feel elegant but add maintenance burden, especially background jobs and release automation before the child agent has real external users.', '43755f32d7c6eea5fe7baa54844ad166a564710a4580598160796f0913317092', 46
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Product Pragmatist

Adopt patterns that prevent repeated support/debug loops. Defer patterns that mainly feel elegant but add maintenance burden, especially background jobs and release automation before the child agent has real external users.', 'Product Pragmatist', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#11');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#12', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', 12, 'Research Scout',
  '### Research Scout

This review is based on internal roadmap evidence, not external technology claims. No new web verification was needed because the task is promotion of locally observed patterns, not assessment of changing third-party APIs.', 'e5c20b36a6f46e372fb850a5c88acc6cd54f1a667af6cd737e1405a5ac72e1b3', 49
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Research Scout

This review is based on internal roadmap evidence, not external technology claims. No new web verification was needed because the task is promotion of locally observed patterns, not assessment of changing third-party APIs.', 'Research Scout', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#12');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#13', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', 13, 'Promotion Path',
  '## Promotion Path

No standards or scaffold templates are changed by this review alone. Next actions:

1. Create explicit decisions for each promoted scaffold group before changing Pritha''s selectable module catalog.
2. Implement scaffold modules in small slices: health/status first, setup second, release hygiene third.
3. Keep background proactivity and deployment automation behind explicit `agent-contract` fields.
4. Re-run `pritha evolve .` after this review to capture the roadmap as a lifecycle lesson.', 'd7689b5a7cb899a82e483427904886ef38c5c186c23ac74a177371fcf7d91cba', 98
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Promotion Path

No standards or scaffold templates are changed by this review alone. Next actions:

1. Create explicit decisions for each promoted scaffold group before changing Pritha''s selectable module catalog.
2. Implement scaffold modules in small slices: health/status first, setup second, release hygiene third.
3. Keep background proactivity and deployment automation behind explicit `agent-contract` fields.
4. Re-run `pritha evolve .` after this review to capture the roadmap as a lifecycle lesson.', 'Promotion Path', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#13');

