- Portability: adapter-needed by default.
- Codex adaptation: translate external patterns into TechScope/Codex-compatible contracts and workflows first.
- Environment-specific caveats: do not assume Claude hooks, Gemini memory, Cursor rules, Hermes gateways or OpenAI Agents SDK primitives behave like Codex project rules.', 'Agent environment compatibility', 'agent-creation-harness', 'agent-creation-harness#8');

