- A MimiClaw article about ESP32-S3 agents should be stored as `adapter-needed`; the transferable concept is constrained always-on agent architecture, not the literal firmware/config model.', 'Examples', 'agent-environment-compatibility', 'agent-environment-compatibility#10');

