| Integration | local endpoint, filesystem, browser, UI, API or deployment success |
| Operability | logs, healthcheck, restartability, repeatability |
| Safety | tool permissions, isolation, untrusted-input handling |', 'Evaluation dimensions', 'agent-harness-evaluation', 'agent-harness-evaluation#7');

