| Security scanning | frontier or specialized scanner | local only for low-risk prefilter | Do not underpower sensitive scanners. |
| Deterministic validation | code/script | code/script | Prefer non-LLM checks where possible. |', 'Runtime placement matrix', 'agent-runtime-placement', 'agent-runtime-placement#6');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-runtime-placement#7', 'agent-runtime-placement', 7, 'Lifecycle rule',
  '## Lifecycle rule

Use three phases:

1. Experiment: use the best reliable model and avoid premature local routing.
2. Productionize: identify stable repeated subtasks, add eval examples and
   measure cost/latency/quality.
3. Scale: offload proven subtasks to local or smaller models with fallback.', 'a0dedb9958d3462ea3765250f87d0d2aefd9d739bc143b8994fbdf89e116f1f9', 57
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Lifecycle rule

Use three phases:

1. Experiment: use the best reliable model and avoid premature local routing.
2. Productionize: identify stable repeated subtasks, add eval examples and
   measure cost/latency/quality.
3. Scale: offload proven subtasks to local or smaller models with fallback.', 'Lifecycle rule', 'agent-runtime-placement', 'agent-runtime-placement#7');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-runtime-placement#8', 'agent-runtime-placement', 8, 'Contract fields',
  '## Contract fields

Every relevant `agent-contract` should include:

- `runtime_placement_profile`;
- `multi_model_routing_requested`;
- `task_routes`;
- `local_inference_required`;
- `local_inference_adapter`;
- `provider_fallbacks`;
- `privacy_routing_rules`;
- `model_budget_policy`;
- `runtime_eval_fixtures`;
- `route_healthcheck`;
- `route_change_log`.

When multi-model routing is requested by the user, task routes should separate
stable runtime class from current candidate:

```yaml
runtime_placement:
  multi_model_routing_requested: true
  task_routes:
    planning:
      runtime_class: frontier-hosted
      current_candidate: checked-current-model-name
      verified: YYYY-MM-DD
      recheck_before_scaffold: true
    classification:
      runtime_class: local-or-small-hosted
      current_candidate: TBD after eval
      eval_required: true
```', '46a20531c92ef1b3ecc4be4bb4161541b9867278ed58ddbb7b89eadbbcfc5d26', 98
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Contract fields

