- For Telegram/CRM/business agents, require allowlist, scoped credentials, logs and human approval for destructive actions.
- For non-coder users, user-facing bot/app responses must be concise and meaningful, not raw queue paths or implementation logs.', 'Safety rules', 'agent-shell-evaluation', 'agent-shell-evaluation#7');

