INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-shell-evaluation#12', 'agent-shell-evaluation', 12, 'Promotion criteria',
  '## Promotion criteria

Promote this standard from `draft` to `active` only after:

- at least one local comparison task using this rubric;
- at least 3-5 dated sources per major runtime being compared;
- one security pass for Telegram/tool/credential risks;
- one update to `07_workflows/media-intake-processing.md` or related workflow showing how the rubric is applied in normal intake.', '974e3c637f284cbca58927af30f11f476a68fcd908dac923d0d36eb8c9d31ff0', 77
);
