- Verified: 2026-05-17.
- Valid for: Techscope agent projects and coding-agent harness design from 2026-05-17 onward.
- Freshness status: current.
- Temporal status: current.
- Recheck when: MCP spec/auth/tool discovery changes, GitHub MCP Server changes toolset behavior, or Codex/OpenAI skills/tool execution model changes.', 'f279212f7bc31ddfce85a6adf35240b922f0058e16efc26437d68343e31edd94', 118
);
