- The operator needs an explicit handoff between "I heard you" and "Codex is solving it".', 'Use When', 'realtime-voice-control-for-codex-agents', 'realtime-voice-control-for-codex-agents#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'realtime-voice-control-for-codex-agents#4', 'realtime-voice-control-for-codex-agents', 4, 'Avoid When',
  '## Avoid When

- The task is pure transcription or simple voice chat with no durable actions.
- There is no trusted server boundary for secrets and tools.
- The voice model would need to perform destructive, public or filesystem actions directly.
- The deployment cannot tolerate microphone, WebRTC or secure-context constraints.
- The project has no way to show pending deep-task status or recover from failed transport.', 'b58afa1a87532dc2187f93bdd01df2c9d1bd9392241a3dae8c22dae0a32c4719', 92
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Avoid When

- The task is pure transcription or simple voice chat with no durable actions.
