- `.memory`, `.logs`, `.tools` are hidden folders and should not sync.
- Scripts and launchd files are runtime infrastructure, not mobile Obsidian notes.', 'Important exclusions', 'obsidian-sync', 'obsidian-sync#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'obsidian-sync#5', 'obsidian-sync', 5, 'Mac mini setup',
  '## Mac mini setup

1. Open Obsidian.
2. Choose `Open folder as vault`.
3. Select:

```text
<TECHSCOPE_ROOT>
```

4. Log in to Obsidian account.
5. Enable the Sync core plugin.
6. Create a remote vault named:

```text
Techscope
```

7. Connect the local vault to the remote vault.
8. Do not start syncing immediately.
9. Open `Settings -> Sync`.
10. Set device name:

```text
Mac mini
```

11. Exclude folder:

```text
01_sources/raw
```

12. Keep `Sync all other types` disabled.
13. Start syncing.
14. Wait for status `Fully Synced`.', '840c14c3a7bb3d58618595d0587a0790116ea02fc0001de69de717932a0f9747', 121
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Mac mini setup

1. Open Obsidian.
2. Choose `Open folder as vault`.
3. Select:

```text
<TECHSCOPE_ROOT>
```

4. Log in to Obsidian account.
5. Enable the Sync core plugin.
6. Create a remote vault named:

```text
Techscope
```

7. Connect the local vault to the remote vault.
8. Do not start syncing immediately.
9. Open `Settings -> Sync`.
10. Set device name:

```text
Mac mini
```

11. Exclude folder:

```text
01_sources/raw
```

12. Keep `Sync all other types` disabled.
13. Start syncing.
14. Wait for status `Fully Synced`.', 'Mac mini setup', 'obsidian-sync', 'obsidian-sync#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
