node scripts/pritha.mjs voice-kit copy --target ../child-agent
```', 'Commands', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 'realtime-voice-control-kit#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'realtime-voice-control-kit#3', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 3, 'Intake Rules',
  '## Intake Rules

- Voice control must be explicit in the agent contract.
- The contract must state microphone/cost/privacy approval status.
- The contract must choose deployment target, runtime isolation profile and
  proactivity mode.
- The contract must choose the deep-task lane: Codex App, Codex CLI, session
  contract, HTTP adapter or no deep-task transport.', '9f3405d66400170b698c6ae997fb108634f4394d492464f73d3ad2209d2215d3', 73
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Intake Rules

- Voice control must be explicit in the agent contract.
- The contract must state microphone/cost/privacy approval status.
- The contract must choose deployment target, runtime isolation profile and
  proactivity mode.
- The contract must choose the deep-task lane: Codex App, Codex CLI, session
  contract, HTTP adapter or no deep-task transport.', 'Intake Rules', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 'realtime-voice-control-kit#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'realtime-voice-control-kit#4', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 4, 'Transfer Steps',
  '## Transfer Steps

1. Run `voice-kit plan` and read the lanes, readiness checks and adaptation
   checklist.
2. Copy the reference pack into the child project.
3. Replace FESPA domain names, repositories, env prefixes and tool schemas.
4. Keep `OPENAI_API_KEY` server-side; issue only ephemeral Realtime credentials
   to the browser.
5. Implement narrow deterministic server tools before exposing them to
   Realtime.
6. Route complex work through a Codex task service with a strict JSON result
   contract.
7. Add tests for instructions, tool schema, result validation, final-turn
   parsing and transport fallback.
8. Record module readiness for `interfaces.realtime`, `tools.realtime`,
   `memory`, `codexTransport`, `operations` and selected external connectors.', '783c3305bc226a8fd27126eb888835e3cbf9a41726fcd1420f7976bb6e96183e', 138
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Transfer Steps

1. Run `voice-kit plan` and read the lanes, readiness checks and adaptation
   checklist.
2. Copy the reference pack into the child project.
3. Replace FESPA domain names, repositories, env prefixes and tool schemas.
4. Keep `OPENAI_API_KEY` server-side; issue only ephemeral Realtime credentials
   to the browser.
5. Implement narrow deterministic server tools before exposing them to
   Realtime.
6. Route complex work through a Codex task service with a strict JSON result
   contract.
7. Add tests for instructions, tool schema, result validation, final-turn
   parsing and transport fallback.
8. Record module readiness for `interfaces.realtime`, `tools.realtime`,
   `memory`, `codexTransport`, `operations` and selected external connectors.', 'Transfer Steps', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 'realtime-voice-control-kit#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'realtime-voice-control-kit#5', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 5, 'Scaffold Rule',
  '## Scaffold Rule

When a child-agent contract mentions `voice`, `realtime`, `speech`, `microphone`
or `голос`, Pritha should add a `realtime-voice` interface placeholder and link
to the FESPA26 reference pack. Do not copy the full FESPA implementation into a
child by default unless the contract calls for a browser Realtime UI and Codex
deep-task lane.', '3af8fa274fb516cbb25d90886df8faaf5cbc1a8bdaca8297eaabd2d0754784e1', 72
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Scaffold Rule

When a child-agent contract mentions `voice`, `realtime`, `speech`, `microphone`
or `голос`, Pritha should add a `realtime-voice` interface placeholder and link
to the FESPA26 reference pack. Do not copy the full FESPA implementation into a
child by default unless the contract calls for a browser Realtime UI and Codex
deep-task lane.', 'Scaffold Rule', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 'realtime-voice-control-kit#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'realtime-voice-control-kit#6', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 6, 'Safety Gates',
  '## Safety Gates

- No direct filesystem, deployment, publication or credential action from the
  Realtime model.
- No public/destructive action without explicit operator confirmation.
- No raw external transcript/media write directly into curated memory.
- Fail closed when Codex transport is unavailable or returns invalid JSON.
- Keep raw audio/video out of normal Git unless a Git LFS/archive policy exists.', '4502d38dd0c8cc6dbbb639903debf44820dca408b938454798dfd97c5ef13082', 81
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Safety Gates

- No direct filesystem, deployment, publication or credential action from the
  Realtime model.
