- No raw external transcript/media write directly into curated memory.
- Fail closed when Codex transport is unavailable or returns invalid JSON.
- Keep raw audio/video out of normal Git unless a Git LFS/archive policy exists.', 'Safety Gates', 'realtime-voice-control-kit', 'realtime-voice-control-kit#6');

