INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-funny-teacher-agent-user-interaction-review#7', '2026-05-26-funny-teacher-agent-user-interaction-review', 7, 'Rule For Future Agents Mother Runs',
  '## Rule For Future Agents Mother Runs

Every created agent should receive a user interaction review after the first meaningful working version. The review must record:

- the initial user prompt;
- the clarifying prompts and answers;
- major changes caused by user feedback;
- failed assumptions;
- UX/product decisions that are not obvious from code;
- reusable patterns for future agents;
- remaining open questions.

This review may be a section inside `agent-post-creation-review`, but for substantial agents it should be a separate report in `11_agents/reports/`.', 'fa0203ce20089427b01a72ffcfed4692235a10b25bb14485f4e95efaddadbdd5', 117
);
