- Added `02_briefs/2026-05-28-pritha-product-identity-self-knowledge-brief.md`.
- Updated release docs/report with installed tooling state.', '50c47f0e1258068aefc843e9e55443c24a6d91c8206c0ec31a2b586b9b23db0a', 63
);
