  'Phase 0 established the baseline harness required before later quality/release work: - `.gitignore` audited and expanded for runtime state, secrets, raw artifacts, caches and local cruft. - `scripts/golden-checks.mjs` created with human and `--json` output. - `scripts/agents-mother.mjs test` gained `--no-report` to support non-mutating self-inspection. - `07_workflows/techscope-quality-audit-log.md` created as append-only phase log. - This baseline report records memory stats, queue status, self-inspection, script line counts, path mismatches and utility hashes.', 'e8cf41488fc3036aef7a9ecf185932c71fbd80f9c08bd8df02ef9d9d82ddcc5b', '2026-05-28', '2026-05-28', '2026-05-30T00:26:15.344Z'
