  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-3-shared-lib-report', '11_agents/reports/2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-3-shared-lib-report.md', 'agent-operations-report', 'complete', 'Techscope Quality Phase 3 Report: Shared Lib',
  'Phase 3 completed successfully. Common helper behavior was extracted into `scripts/lib/*` and runtime scripts now import shared root, frontmatter, env, date and slug helpers instead of carrying independent copies. The migration was intentionally conservative: parser semantics were kept to the same frontmatter subset used before Phase 3. Generated child-agent template snippets inside `agents-mother.mjs` remain standalone because Phase 5 snapshot tests and Phase 9 modularization are the safer point to change scaffold output.', '3b4a5225ed626e62d53b4135ab3544400963202a99d95a787fb242655fe7941b', '2026-05-28', '2026-05-28', '2026-05-30T00:26:15.344Z'
