- `package.json`
  - Added `quality`: `node scripts/quality-gate.mjs`.
- `.gitignore`
  - Ignores `.memory/reports/` generated gate JSON snapshots.', '55ad5cd73b2707109bbaaab2b34df61afc7dd5361c650ef53c51b0e3e28f81e3', 96
);
