node scripts/agents-mother/index.mjs test <project-path>
```

This is still a partial Phase 9 result. The full modularization is not complete
until scaffold, handoff, operations, deployment, evolve and registry logic are
also separated and the full Phase 9 command matrix is verified.', 'Summary', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9b-agents-mother-test-module-report', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9b-agents-mother-test-module-report#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9b-agents-mother-test-module-report#3', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9b-agents-mother-test-module-report', 3, 'Changes made',
  '## Changes made

Created:

- `scripts/agents-mother/test.mjs`
  - `fileExists`
  - `readJsonIfExists`
  - `runProjectCommand`
  - `packageScripts`
  - `detectProject`
  - `checkResult`
  - `testProject`
  - `recommendationForProject`
- `tests/agents-mother-test-module.test.mjs`

Updated:

- `scripts/agents-mother/index.mjs`
  - Imports project inspection helpers from `./test.mjs`.
  - Keeps `handoff`, `operations`, `deploy` and `evolve` working against the
    shared inspection helpers.', '500fcbc064bce955a572fc6aecf31b02073451b47cc957f434a5e9ac232dabad', 64
);
