- `codex-task-transport`: define a standard task payload, status set, validation rule and fallback behavior for Codex App/CLI transports.
- `event-reportage-agent`: source intake, operational memory, reviewed feed cards and explicit publication gate.', 'Reusable Standard Candidates', '2026-05-29-fespa26-voice-control-and-feed-memory-update', '2026-05-29-fespa26-voice-control-and-feed-memory-update#9');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-29-fespa26-voice-control-and-feed-memory-update#10', '2026-05-29-fespa26-voice-control-and-feed-memory-update', 10, 'Promotion Path',
  '## Promotion Path

- Update `04_standards/realtime-voice-control-for-codex-agents.md` from draft to active with version-bound caveats.
- Consider a future separate standard for event/reportage agents after one more event-like descendant reuses FESPA26''s feed-memory lifecycle.
- Consider a future separate standard for `CodexTaskService` once another agent needs Codex App/thread transport from voice.', '484c4bb50787f4b08d0ada0a5ef8167b73cd57d2412adf292c29540d3e220c35', 65
);
