INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report#4', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report', 4, 'Transferable Pattern',
  '## Transferable Pattern

FESPA26 confirms a five-lane architecture:

- browser voice lane: microphone, WebRTC, data channel, transcript and remote
  audio;
- Realtime dispatcher lane: concise instructions and narrow tool schemas;
- deterministic server-tool lane: validation, durable writes, read-only status
  and explicit confirmation gates;
- Codex deep-task lane: Codex App, CLI, session contract or HTTP thread
  transport;
- artifact lane: memory, feed/card updates, task logs and operator-visible
  status.', '47d9ea8f487f79928b1d64e2a8372063adb7c8db9e02a10fe41bdc8862a72f74', 91
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Transferable Pattern

FESPA26 confirms a five-lane architecture:

- browser voice lane: microphone, WebRTC, data channel, transcript and remote
  audio;
- Realtime dispatcher lane: concise instructions and narrow tool schemas;
- deterministic server-tool lane: validation, durable writes, read-only status
  and explicit confirmation gates;
- Codex deep-task lane: Codex App, CLI, session contract or HTTP thread
  transport;
- artifact lane: memory, feed/card updates, task logs and operator-visible
  status.', 'Transferable Pattern', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report#5', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report', 5, 'What Must Be Adapted',
  '## What Must Be Adapted

- Replace FESPA-specific repositories and feed/card concepts.
- Replace `FESPA_*` env names and domain prompts.
- Define descendant-specific tool schemas and confirmation gates.
- Decide whether Codex App, Codex CLI, session-contract or HTTP thread
  transport is selected.
- Add readiness checks for Realtime credentials, memory, Codex transport and
  external connectors.', 'b8fffa4421a1b27e682cb0e24428a8ae15f112025d9c8c035de76a9da201ef9d', 75
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## What Must Be Adapted

- Replace FESPA-specific repositories and feed/card concepts.
- Replace `FESPA_*` env names and domain prompts.
- Define descendant-specific tool schemas and confirmation gates.
- Decide whether Codex App, Codex CLI, session-contract or HTTP thread
  transport is selected.
- Add readiness checks for Realtime credentials, memory, Codex transport and
  external connectors.', 'What Must Be Adapted', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report#6', '2026-05-30-fespa26-voice-control-pattern-ingestion-report', 6, 'Safety Decision',
  '## Safety Decision

The code is kept as a reference pack, not automatically copied into every
scaffold. Pritha should include the `realtime-voice` interface placeholder when
the contract mentions voice/realtime, and copy the full pack only when the
contract needs browser Realtime UI plus Codex deep-task transport.', '9731d7342a2f6c130c8c618742dd238513d70f64abc9340ed15b97ce93839073', 63
);
